IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q04-TXN-VALIDATION.
*> Checks type (C/D) and amount > 0.
*> Priority: ERR_TYPE -> ERR_MALFORMED -> ERR_AMOUNT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-TXN-TYPE         PIC X(1).
01  WS-RAW-AMT          PIC X(15).
01  WS-AMOUNT           PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-TXN-TYPE
    ACCEPT WS-RAW-AMT

    IF WS-TXN-TYPE NOT = "C" AND WS-TXN-TYPE NOT = "D"
        DISPLAY "ERR_TYPE"
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    IF FUNCTION TEST-NUMVAL(WS-RAW-AMT) NOT = 0
        DISPLAY "ERR_MALFORMED"
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    COMPUTE WS-AMOUNT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-RAW-AMT)

    IF WS-AMOUNT <= 0
        DISPLAY "ERR_AMOUNT"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "ACCEPTED"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
